In the following year, Daley competed in the 2012 Olympics and won a bronze medal.
"I knew that this is what I've been dreaming about all my life: diving in front of home spectators at the Olympics, and there's no better feeling," he said.
It was also his first song that resonated with him in his physiques until the Olympics - Proud by Heather Small - an inspiration to the choice and still creepy.
